## Risk Assessment

### T1 — Transport Fixes
- **Risk:** LOW
- **Mitigation:** Localized to websocket.ts; existing tests cover baseline
- **Rollback:** Easy to revert atomic request() function

### T2 — Typed Protocol
- **Risk:** LOW (backward-compatible)
- **Mitigation:** Legacy message wrapping; gradual deprecation window
